# NOTE for learning: unlike .gitignore, Docker needs **/ to match
# nested folders. Plain "bin/" only excludes a root-level bin folder,
# NOT OrderManagement.Api/bin etc. Missing the **/ prefix was the
# cause of a NETSDK1064 build failure (host obj/ with stale
# project.assets.json overwrote the container's restored files).
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/TestResults/
*.user
.git/
docker-compose*.yml
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
